      "translation_chunk_count": 5,
      "translation_input": "Le 18 octobre 2025. une tempête de poussière a réduit la production solaire de 34 % en quinze minutes. La température de l'armoire de batteries a augmenté de 8 °C. tandis que le ventilateur de l'onduleur produisait une vibration anormale. Au lieu d'arrêter la station, le système a coupé le chauffage secondaire, réduit certains éclairages et démarré le groupe de secours Il a identifié trois causes possibles des débris sur les panneaux, un roulement usé et une résistance croissante dans un connecteur de batterie",
      "translated_text": "It's the 18th of October 2025. A dust storm reduced solar output by 34% in 15 minutes. The temperature of the battery compartment has risen by 8°C. While the inverter fan was producing an abnormal vibration. Instead of shutting down the station, the system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights, and started the rescue group. It identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn-out bearing, and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "It's the 18th of October 2025. A dust storm reduced solar output by 34% in 15 minutes. The temperature of the battery compartment has risen by 8°C. While the inverter fan was producing an abnormal vibration. Instead of shutting down the station, the system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights, and started the rescue group. It identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn-out bearing, and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "spell_changes": []
    },
